//# Flags:  GENERIC    Properties has type params (e.g. Properties<TItem, TKey>)
//#         NARROWED   ≥1 narrowed event (README §3)
//#         NESTED     ≥1 nested option component (README §6)
//#         EXTENSION  component is an extension (only Validator today)
//#         EXTRA      the `& { … }` block of I__Name__Options is non-empty
//#                    (GENERIC or a template or a root subscribable option)
//#         TEMPLATE / ROOT_SUBSCRIBABLE / SUBSCRIBABLE / INDEPENDENT_EVENTS
//#                    the matching list (README §2, §4, §5) is non-empty
//#         RAF / PORTAL   README §1
